 "courseManagement.course", "pk": 1, "fields": {"name": "Interview Preparation Course", "caption": "Ultimate course to ace your Interviews", "price": 19998, "discount_percentage": 50, "archive": false, "popular": true, "premium": true, "pre_recorded": false, "lectures": 24, "class_duration": "01:30", "course_duration": 13, "course_duration_in_months": null, "projects": 4, "mobile_computer": true, "certificate": true, "short_description": "This intense fast track course covers the 30+ coding patterns along with 500+ handpicked standard questions to crack any product based companies.", "description": "This intense course is mainly designed for job aspirants who want to master their coding skills in less time and ace their interviews at product-based companies. This unique course initially starts with a quick revision of basic language and data structures before moving on to the main core of the course, which is patterns. Those include 30+ coding patterns along with 500+ handpicked practice questions, which one needs to know before jumping into MAANG interviews. Each pattern will be explained and solved with five different variations of questions to understand the concept effectively. There will be practise problems provided for each pattern, ranging in difficulty from easy to difficult. Assignments will be provided at the end of the course to help you improve the coding abilities you've learned. You can better understand the patterns mentioned above with the assistance of these assignments.", "requirements": "Lot of dedication\r\nConsistency\r\nRigorous Practice", "author_name": "Akhil Gunti", "author_message": "I have made this course completely beginner-friendly. I went over all of the concepts, from basic to advanced. No prerequisites are needed, we will be covering all the concepts. This course is for all who are looking to make a career in the software field. Good luck, and hope to see you at Maang!!!", "author_photo": "default.png", "thumbnail": "course_thumbnails/interview-prep-course.svg", "demo_video": null, "payment_id": "pl_Ls3RCv3NNcGA4Y", "eligibility": "", "role": null, "revoke_duration_in_days": 45, "certificate_count": null}}, {"model": "courseManagement.course", "pk": 2, "fields": {"name": "System Design ( for 2+ years Job Experience)", "caption": "Ultimate course to ace your Interviews", "price": 40000, "discount_percentage": 50, "archive": false, "popular": false, "premium": false, "pre_recorded": false, "lectures": 15, "class_duration": "01:30", "course_duration": 8, "course_duration_in_months": null, "projects": 8, "mobile_computer": true, "certificate": true, "short_description": "This course covers the fundamentals of how to design any system from scratch to advanced level and covers the technical core concepts of system design.", "description": "This course covers all the system design fundamental concepts, their pictorial representations, and core concepts. A thorough examination of each system and its applications will be discussed. A detailed walk through on how to build a system from scratch, how to collect requirements, which tech to be used in which scenarios etc.This course covers 12 classic system design problems which give one a decent knowledge in coming up with their own system.By the end of the course, assigned mentor will be taking 2 mock interviews to enhance your system design skills, which are attained from this course.", "requirements": "Lot of dedication\r\nConsistency\r\nNothing", "author_name": "Abhishek N", "author_message": "I have made this course completely beginner-friendly. I went over all of the concepts, from basic to advanced. No prerequisites are needed, we will be covering all the concepts. This course is for all who are looking to make a career in the software field. Good luck, and hope to see you at Maang!!!", "author_photo": "default.png", "thumbnail": "course_thumbnails/system-design-course.svg", "demo_video": null, "payment_id": "pl_Ls3Vj85qvcGPFn", "eligibility": null, "role": null, "revoke_duration_in_days": null, "certificate_count": null}}, {"model": "courseManagement.course", "pk": 3, "fields": {"name": "Industrial Internship (for students)", "caption": "Become a Real-Time Problem Solver", "price": 24000, "discount_percentage": 50, "archive": false, "popular": true, "premium": false, "pre_recorded": false, "lectures": 24, "class_duration": "01:30", "course_duration": 8, "course_duration_in_months": null, "projects": 1, "mobile_computer": true, "certificate": true, "short_description": "Unlock the power of real-world problem-solving as a MAANG Careers intern. Engage in hands-on experience through real-time projects, shaping the future with innovative solutions.", "description": "This Industrial Internship covers algorithmic-based real-time projects, empowering students to swiftly enhance their coding skills. Throughout the program, our dedicated mentors, experienced MAANG employees, provide personalized guidance and a collaborative learning environment. With a strong focus on hands-on experience, interns develop proficiency in tackling industry-specific challenges and crafting innovative solutions. \r\nProject placements offer exceptional career opportunities, as participants gain invaluable exposure to real-world scenarios. The program's emphasis on practical problem-solving ensures that interns are well-prepared to excel in job interviews and stand out in the competitive job market. \r\nAt MAANG Careers, we take immense pride in upholding high standards of quality. Our interns work on impactful projects that address pressing industry needs, contributing to the advancement of industrial technology. \r\nJoin us on this transformative journey to shape the future of the tech industry. Through our Industrial Internship, you will not only gain valuable skills but also become a confident, industry-ready expert poised for success in your career.", "requirements": "Lot of dedication\r\nConsistency\r\nNothing", "author_name": "Sai Kishore", "author_message": "With a passion for empowering aspiring professionals, this internship is designed for anyone looking to forge a rewarding career in the software field. My hope is that you will find this journey both enriching and enlightening, providing you with the skills and knowledge to excel in the ever-evolving tech industry. Wishing you the best of luck on this transformative learning experience, and I eagerly look forward to welcoming you to MAANG, where we embark on this exciting journey together!", "author_photo": "course_author_photos/saikishore.jpg", "thumbnail": "course_thumbnails/new_intership_1.jpg", "demo_video": null, "payment_id": "pl_Ls3XyYqHkbbCi0", "eligibility": null, "role": null, "revoke_duration_in_days": null, "certificate_count": null}}, {"model": "courseManagement.emidetails", "pk": 2, "fields": {"emi_type": "test  emi", "instament_number": 3, "total_payment": 24000, "course": 1, "emi_duration": 15}}, {"model": "courseManagement.instamentdetails", "pk": 3, "fields": {"emi_type": 2, "instalment": 1, "payment_id": null, "amount": 12000}}, {"model": "courseManagement.instamentdetails", "pk": 4, "fields": {"emi_type": 2, "instalment": 2, "payment_id": null, "amount": 8000}}, {"model": "courseManagement.instamentdetails", "pk": 5, "fields": {"emi_type": 2, "instalment": 3, "payment_id": null, "amount": 5000}}, {"model": "courseManagement.week", "pk": 7, "fields": {"name": "Week 1", "week": 1, "course": 1, "lock": false}}, {"model": "courseManagement.week", "pk": 9, "fields": {"name": "Week 2", "week": 2, "course": 1, "lock": false}}, {"model": "courseManagement.week", "pk": 10, "fields": {"name": "Week 3", "week": 3, "course": 1, "lock": false}}, {"model": "courseManagement.week", "pk": 11, "fields": {"name": "Week 4", "week": 4, "course": 1, "lock": false}}, {"model": "courseManagement.week", "pk": 12, "fields": {"name": "Week 5", "week": 5, "course": 1, "lock": true}}, {"model": "courseManagement.week", "pk": 13, "fields": {"name": 